@startuml manual_student_add_flow
title Add Managed Student Manually - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Tutor
participant API
participant AddStudentManuallyHandler
database Database

Tutor -> API: POST /api/tutors/me/students
API -> AddStudentManuallyHandler: AddStudentManuallyCommand
AddStudentManuallyHandler -> Database: Find Tutor by UserAccountId
AddStudentManuallyHandler -> AddStudentManuallyHandler: Create Student(DisplayName)\nwithout UserAccount
AddStudentManuallyHandler -> AddStudentManuallyHandler: Create active TutoringAgreement\nwith optional HourlyRate
AddStudentManuallyHandler -> Database: Save Student and TutoringAgreement
AddStudentManuallyHandler --> API: StudentId, AgreementId
API --> Tutor: 201 Created

note right of AddStudentManuallyHandler
  No UserAccount is created.
  The managed student cannot log in.
end note

@enduml
